ressure building ne of \nthe forecast area, nely winds will keep Sunday's temperatures \ncooler than at the start of the period (but still quite warm). \nDewpoints look to be modestly lower as well (in the 60s rather \nthan the 70s), and this drier pattern will continue through the \nend of the period. Even so, Labor Day looks to be quite warm, with\nabove average temperatures in the upper 80s expected across the \narea. Other than this, the weather will be quite pleasant and \nsunny, with the exception of an isolated diurnally driven \nthunderstorm in s or se.",
